  "verseCount": 23,
  "content": [
    {
      "name": "chapter",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "number": "33",
        "style": "c",
        "sid": "EXO 33"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "33",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 33:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "Waaqayyo",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "EXO.33.1",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "EXO.33.1"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Museedhaan akkana jedhe; \"Atii fi sabni ati biyya Gibxiitii baaftee fidde kun asii baʼaatii gara biyya ani Abrahaamiif, Yisihaaqii fi Yaaqoobiif, 'Ani sanyii keetiif nan kenna' jedhee kakadhe sanaa dhaqaa.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.33.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.33.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 33:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ani ergamaa koo fuula kee duraan ergee Kanaʼaanota, Amoorota, Heetota, Feerzota, Hiiwotaa fi Yebuusota ariʼee nan baasa.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.33.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.33.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 33:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gara biyya aannanii fi dammi keessaa burquu dhaqi. Garuu waan ati saba mata jabeessa taateef ani akka karaatti si hin balleessineef si wajjin hin deemu.\"",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.33.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.33.3"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 33:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Jarri yommuu oduu hamaa kana dhagaʼanitti gadduu jalqaban; isaan keessaas namni tokko iyyuu faaya tokko illee hin kaaʼanne.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.33.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.33.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 33:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "Waaqayyo",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "EXO.33.5",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "EXO.33.5"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Museedhaan akkana jedheeraatii; \"Saba Israaʼeliin akkana jedhi; 'Isin saba mata jabeeyyii dha. Ani utuu yeruma muraasa illee isin wajjin deemee silaa isin balleessa ture; isin amma faayawwan keessan of irraa baasaa; anis waanan isin godhu nan murteessaa.' \"",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.33.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.33.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 33:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kanaafuu Israaʼeloonni Gaara Kooreeb biratti faayawwan isaanii of irraa baasan.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.33.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.33.6"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Dunkaana Wal gaʼii",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 33:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Museen dunkaana tokko fuudhee iddoo qubataa sana keessaa baasee achi fageessee dhaaba ture; dunkaana sanas, \"dunkaana wal gaʼii\" jedhee moggaase. Namni",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.33.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.33.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "Waaqayyoon",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "EXO.33.7",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "EXO.33.7"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "barbaadatu hundinuu iddoo qubataa sana keessaa baʼee gara dunkaana wal gaʼii sanaa dhaqa ture.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.33.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.33.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 33:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yeroo Museen baʼee gara dunkaana sanaa dhaqu hunda sabni hundinuu kaʼee balbala dunkaana ofii isaa dura dhaabatee hamma inni dunkaanicha seenutti ilaala ture.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.33.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.33.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 33:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yeroo Museen dunkaana sana seenutti utubaan duumessaa gad buʼee balbala dunkaanichaa dura dhaabata ture;",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.33.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.33.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "Waaqayyos",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "EXO.33.9",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "EXO.33.9"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Musee wajjin dubbata ture.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.33.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.33.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 33:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Sabni yeroo utubaa duumessaa kan balbala dunkaanaa dura dhaabatu argutti hundi isaa ol kaʼee tokkoon tokkoon namaa dunkaana ofii isaa duratti sagada ture.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.33.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.33.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 33:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "Waaqayyos",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "EXO.33.11",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "EXO.33.11"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "akkuma nama michuu isaa wajjin haasaʼu tokkootti ifumaan ifatti Museetti dubbachaa ture. Ergasiis Museen iddoo qubataatti deebiʼa ture; gargaaraan isaa, Iyyaasuun ilmi Nuuni dargaggeessi suni garuu dunkaana sana biraa hin deemu ture.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.33.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.33.11"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Musee fi Ulfina",
          "type": "text"
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "Waaqayyoo",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 33:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Museen",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.33.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.33.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "Waaqayyoon",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "EXO.33.12",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "EXO.33.12"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "akkana jedhe; \"Ilaa, ati, 'saba kana dura buʼii baasi' naan jetteerta; garuu ana wajjin eenyun akka ergitu na hin beeksifne. Ati, 'Ani maqaadhaan si beeka; ati na biratti fudhatama argateerta' jette.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.33.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.33.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 33:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ammas ani fuula kee duratti surraa argadhee yoon jiraadhe, akka ani si beekuu fi akka ani fuula kee duratti surraa argadhuuf karaa kee na barsiisi; akka sabni kun saba kee taʼes yaadadhu.\"",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.33.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.33.13"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 33:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "Waaqayyos",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "EXO.33.14",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "EXO.33.14"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "deebisee, \"Ani si wajjin nan deema; boqonnaas siifin kenna\" jedhe.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.33.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.33.14"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 33:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Museen immoo akkana jedheen; \"Yoo ati nu wajjin deemuu baate, asii nu hin baasin.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.33.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.33.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 33:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ati nu wajjin deemuu baannaan namni akkamiin akka ati anaa fi saba keetti gammaddu beeka? Wanni anaa fi saba kee saboota lafa irraa kaan hunda irraa addaan baasu biraa maali ree?\"",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.33.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.33.16"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 33:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "Waaqayyo",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "EXO.33.17",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "EXO.33.17"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "immoo Museedhaan, \"Ani waan ati amma kadhatte kana nan godha; ati fuula koo duratti ayyaana argatteertaatii; anis maqaadhaan si beeka\" jedhe.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.33.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.33.17"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 33:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Museenis, \"Maaloo ulfina kee na argisiisi\" jedhe.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.33.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.33.18"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 33:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "Waaqayyo",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "EXO.33.19",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "EXO.33.19"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "immoo akkana jedhe; \"Ani gaarummaa koo hundumaa fuula kee dura nan dabarsa; maqaa",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.33.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.33.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "Waaqayyoo",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "EXO.33.19",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "EXO.33.19"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "fuula kee duratti nan labsa. Ani kanan maaru nan maara; kanan garaa laafuufiis garaa nan laafa.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.33.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.33.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 33:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Garuu waan namni fuula koo argee jiraachuu hin dandeenyeef ati fuula koo arguu hin dandeessu.\"",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.33.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.33.20"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 33:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ergasiis",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.33.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.33.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "Waaqayyo",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "EXO.33.21",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "EXO.33.21"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "akkana jedhe; \"Kunoo as na bira iddoon ati kattaa irra dhaabachuu dandeessu jira.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.33.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.33.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
